-quilt","title":"Shaker quilt","artist":"Room setting from the Village’s collection","medium":"Shaker objects","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shaker_Quilt,_Brick_Dwelling,_Hancock_Shaker_Village.jpg","imageUrl":"data/hsv/images/hsv-r-brick-dwelling-shaker-quilt.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Brick Dwelling","floor":"G"},{"id":"hsv-r-brick-dwelling-signs-of-the-shaker-rules","title":"Signs of the Shaker rules","artist":"Room setting from the Village’s collection","medium":"Room setting","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Reproductions_of_cautionary_signs_inside_the_Brick_Dwelling_building,_where_residents_were_segregated_by_sex,_at_Hancock_Shaker_,_by_Carol_M._Highsmith,_2019,_from_the_Library_of_Congress_-_master-pnp-highsm-57900-57911a.tif","imageUrl":"data/hsv/images/hsv-r-brick-dwelling-signs-of-the-shaker-rules.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Brick Dwelling","floor":"G"},{"id":"hsv-x-couture-from-the-world-inspired-by-the-shake","title":"Couture from the World: Inspired by the Shakers","artist":"Exhibition","date":"June 7 – November 30, 2026","medium":"Exhibition","url":"https://hancockshakervillage.org/exhibition/couture-from-the-world-inspired-by-the-shakers-june-7-november-30/","imageUrl":"data/hsv/images/hsv-x-couture-from-the-world-inspired-by-the-shake.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Brick Dwelling","floor":"G"},{"id":"hsv-x-elements-of-harmony-may-17-november-30","title":"Elements of Harmony","artist":"Exhibition","date":"May 17 – November 30, 2026","medium":"Exhibition","url":"https://hancockshakervillage.org/exhibition/elements-of-harmony-may-17-november-30/","imageUrl":"data/hsv/images/hsv-x-elements-of-harmony-may-17-november-30.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Brick Dwelling","floor":"G"},{"id":"hsv-x-the-city-of-peace-photographs-by-dylan-kubis","title":"The City of Peace: Photographs by Dylan Kubis","artist":"Exhibition","date":"April 12 – November 30, 2026","medium":"Exhibition","url":"https://hancockshakervillage.org/exhibitio